.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK PROJECT ACTIVITY"
.SH NAME
hamstik project activity \- Show a project's activity feed (newest first)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik project activity [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a project's activity feed (newest first)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --since
Only events strictly after this RFC 3339 timestamp
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
